int a = 5, b = 10;
printf("%d", a++ + ++b);

TCS NQT Pseudo-code: What will be the value of c after executing:
Integer a=2, b=4, c=8;
a = b + c;
b = a - b;
c = a - b;
print c;

Infosys Pseudo-Code: What is the output of the recursive call solve(3)?
int solve(int n) {
  if (n <= 1) return 1;
  return n * solve(n - 1) + 2;
}

